<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Necromancer profession</h1>
<p>Primary stats: BRA, CHA
</p><p>This group of ex-clerics have moved away from the healing spells and now
dabble in evil magic. There are stories floating around that some have
even raised the dead from their final resting place and used the zombies
for their own gain.
</p><p>The Necromancers' guild hides in the crypts beneath the ruins of an old
church in the cemetery. Its head is Wicca the Tainted One. To join, stand
before Wicca and type <a cmd='#'>join</a>. Conjurers and sorcerers are turned away, and
so is anyone good (alignment +350 or more). First you must prove yourself
worthy by finishing the Necromancer's Guild quest; Wicca sends you to
Murim the bartender to begin it. To leave the guild, insult the Master;
but a member who is banished can never come back.
</p><p>Attributes:
</p>
<pre> Bra	+3
 Cha	+2
 Dex	+1
 Div	 0
 Str	-1
 HP	-2
 Con	-3
 Mag	-7
</pre>
